{"id":"n36018-1-7","stage":1,"title":"백 · 百","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n36018-1-7-1","ko":"이 노래가 정말 좋아서 열 번은 들은 것 같아.","zh":"我真的很喜欢这首歌，感觉已经听了不下十遍了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"노래가","meaning":"歌，歌曲，唱歌","explanation":"노래：歌，歌曲，唱歌；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"노래","audio":"/audio/edcad1c9c3dba9e99435.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20195","senseId":"1","lemma":"노래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아서","meaning":"喜爱，喜欢","explanation":"좋다：喜爱，喜欢；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"10","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"열","meaning":"十","explanation":"열：十","readings":[{"term":"열","audio":"/audio/6f4112362e973dd65e65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67805","senseId":"1","lemma":"열","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"번은","meaning":"次，遍","explanation":"번：次，遍；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"번","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26846","senseId":"2","lemma":"번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들은","meaning":"听","explanation":"듣다：听；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"2","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"edcad1c9c3dba9e9","term":"노래","zh":"歌，歌曲，唱歌","audio":"/audio/edcad1c9c3dba9e99435.mp3","entryId":"20195","definition":"给具有韵律的歌词添加曲子的音乐；或放声唱出那样的音乐。","pronunciation":["노래"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"喜爱，喜欢","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某事或某个对象很称心、很满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"6f4112362e973dd6","term":"열","zh":"十","audio":"/audio/6f4112362e973dd65e65.mp3","entryId":"67805","definition":"九加一后所得的数目。","pronunciation":["열ː"]},{"id":"dfccc17e2997aa8d","term":"번","zh":"次，遍","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3","entryId":"26846","definition":"计算事情次数的数量单位。","pronunciation":["번"]},{"id":"58977b8705722edc","term":"듣다","zh":"听","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3","entryId":"74104","definition":"聆听他人的话或声音等。","pronunciation":["듣따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/ffbf0aab39825b6ad64f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n36018-1-7-2","ko":"나는 백 번도 넘게 들었는걸?","zh":"我可是听了上百遍呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"백","meaning":"百","explanation":"백：百","readings":[{"term":"백","audio":"/audio/f30a48779ab0b5cdf1b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36018","senseId":"1","lemma":"백","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"번도","meaning":"次，遍","explanation":"번：次，遍；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"번","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26846","senseId":"2","lemma":"번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"넘게","meaning":"过，超过","explanation":"넘다：过，超过；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"넘다","audio":"/audio/bd8fe9471c90dfb81875.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64524","senseId":"4","lemma":"넘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들었는걸?","meaning":"听","explanation":"듣다：听；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는걸：表示新发现、感叹或与对方预期不同的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"2","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"f30a48779ab0b5cd","term":"백","zh":"百","audio":"/audio/f30a48779ab0b5cdf1b3.mp3","entryId":"36018","definition":"十的十倍数的。","pronunciation":["백"]},{"id":"dfccc17e2997aa8d","term":"번","zh":"次，遍","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3","entryId":"26846","definition":"计算事情次数的数量单位。","pronunciation":["번"]},{"id":"bd8fe9471c90dfb8","term":"넘다","zh":"过，超过","audio":"/audio/bd8fe9471c90dfb81875.mp3","entryId":"64524","definition":"超出一定的标准或限度。","pronunciation":["넘ː따"]},{"id":"58977b8705722edc","term":"듣다","zh":"听","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3","entryId":"74104","definition":"聆听他人的话或声音等。","pronunciation":["듣따"]}],"audio":"/audio/582e10d8df8eee3b1206.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.5,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=36018","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":39,"sequenceScore":1.8402,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我真的很喜欢这首歌，感觉已经听了不下十遍了。","我可是听了上百遍呢。","这栋公寓看起来好贵啊，大概要多少钱呢？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我真的很喜欢这首歌，感觉已经听了不下十遍了。","我可是听了上百遍呢。","这栋公寓看起来好贵啊，大概要多少钱呢？"],"answer":1}]}
